port_pinfile.py + probes.json. Fork branch has 5 commits total. Owner should be told about the Colibri leak fix (upstreamable finding).", "status": "idle", "done": ["validate.py LOP + leak fix"], "next": ["poll Gate 0", "report Colibri validate.py leak to owner as upstream candidate"], "blockers": ["narrowed Gate 0: Stage-1 dual-op store", "RTX rig for real spectra + S-E1 E2E"], "decisions": [], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "5c3486e5", "author_model": "command_code/z-ai/glm-5.3-flash"}');
