ured bytes; skew not sharp: 54% experts/layer, saturation N=54). Finding 2: KL disarmed-vs-disarmed isolation AUTHORIZED (instrument resolution question; bears on D0 +48%). Finding 3: type-(ii) DECLINED (SYNC-JOIN sync = second terminal defect; capture native under #132). Dispatched: re-derivation -> collector (offline, method-constrained); KL isolation x3 pairs -> rig worker. No further E1 legs; E1 harness reusable; ARM 008 STOP untriggered. Re-derivation goes to OWNER with architect recommendation — line retirement is the owner call.", "status": "running", "done": [], "next": [], "blockers": [], "decisions": [], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "0082a065-08b4-49fa-bd6e-5333e1ec31ba", "author_model": ""}');
