oughput deliverable; static-ranking ~45% coverage ceiling = the campaign scientific result. OWNER PACKAGE ASSEMBLED AND DELIVERED to owner this turn. KL isolation still running.", "status": "running", "done": [], "next": [], "blockers": [], "decisions": [], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "0082a065-08b4-49fa-bd6e-5333e1ec31ba", "author_model": ""}');
