rtifacts (27G) tipped it; evidence moved to /mnt/storage/hydra-evidence/e1-campaign (3.2T free), .evidence-e1 symlink shim, 23G freed, production unaffected. GPU legs PAUSED until quiet. Next: quiet-window KL re-run (runner patched: cmp -f fix, WorkDisk->storage path).", "status": "running", "done": [], "next": [], "blockers": [], "decisions": [], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "0082a065-08b4-49fa-bd6e-5333e1ec31ba", "author_model": ""}');
