n-all); (4) non-comparability rule carried: absolute tok/s NOT comparable to D22/bridge (armed-but-disarmed WIP binary), draft-KV-on-CUDA0 would be reported not absorbed. KL defect campaign: histogram deferred behind MTP arm; eager binary barred from quality-gated measurement (§67 standing rule).", "status": "running", "done": [], "next": [], "blockers": [], "decisions": [], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "0082a065-08b4-49fa-bd6e-5333e1ec31ba", "author_model": ""}');
