waiting owner ruling to close the track"], "decisions": ["recommendation to owner: SHELVE - hybrid fails measured f check, bound is unachievable"], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "claude-sonnet5-lead-20260921", "author_model": ""}');
