ate from the gated task list): just added a temporary env-gated skip (DIAG_C1PRIME_SKIP_PUBLICATION_LIFETIME) in tests/test-moe-cache.cpp to unblock testing the same-type-IQ3_S case under GGML_CUDA_DISABLE_FUSION=1.", "status": "running", "done": [], "next": ["Build + run test-moe-cache with DIAG_C1PRIME_SKIP_PUBLICATION_LIFETIME=1 GGML_CUDA_DISABLE_FUSION=1 to get the unfused same-type-IQ3_S pass/fail result (c1′ part 2)", "Run c2′ no-cache depth-sensitivity comparison", "Update PROJECT_STATUS.md VOID→SUSPENDED, comment on #791, revert diagnostics, report back to architect"], "blockers": ["omp CLI not available in this shell to get daemon count"], "decisions": [], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "claude-sonnet5-lead-20260921", "author_model": ""}');
INSERT INTO orch_turns(n, project_id, track_id, ts, summary, status, done, next, blockers, decisions, knowledge, author_agent, author_model, raw) VALUES(1277, 'p-7719544617', 't-d1cf43b723', '2026-09-22T22:17:26.455Z', '§150-152 review closed. Verdict: LATENT-for-this-model. c1′: model''s exact triple (IQ3_XXS/IQ3_S/IQ4_NL) passes stock build, fusion=0 confirmed by trace (ggml-cuda.cu:1790 blocks fusion on type mismatch). Two fusion-isolation attempts both corrupted the control case (confounded) — stopped patching, filed as #791 observation instead. Short-prompt counters: covered=48/fallback=0 (real grouped path). c2′: KL(A||A0)=1.90 nats but determinism floor (A vs A_repeat)=0.83 nats — token-0 depth instability, not defect. Suspension lifted. PROJECT_STATUS.md finding 2 restored to STANDS; 3060 precaution lifted. #791 comment posted, kept open P1. All diagnostics reverted, submodule clean (verified by me and architect).', 'running', '[]', '["Await architect confirmation track is back to normal"]', '[]', '["Verdict: LATENT-for-this-model", "5060 Ti A/B recommendation STANDS", "3060 SHELVE unaffected", "Stopped fusion-isolation patching after two confounded attempts"]', '{"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}', 'claude-sonnet5-lead-20260921', '', '{"n": 1277, "ts": "2026-09-22T22:17:26.455Z", "summary": "§150-152 review closed. Verdict: LATENT-for-this-model. c1′: model''s exact triple (IQ3_XXS/IQ3_S/IQ4_NL) passes stock build, fusion=0 confirmed by trace (ggml-cuda.cu:1790 blocks fusion on type mismatch). Two fusion-isolation attempts both corrupted the control case (confounded) — stopped patching, filed as #791 observation instead. Short-prompt counters: covered=48/fallback=0 (real grouped path). c2′: KL(A||A0)=1.90 nats but determinism floor (A vs A_repeat)=0.83 nats — token-0 depth instability, not defect. Suspension lifted. PROJECT_STATUS.md finding 2 restored to STANDS; 3060 precaution lifted. #791 comment posted, kept open P1. All diagnostics reverted, submodule clean (verified by me and architect).", "status": "running", "done": [], "next": ["Await architect confirmation track is back to normal"], "blockers": [], "decisions": ["Verdict: LATENT-for-this-model", "5060 Ti A/B recommendation STANDS", "3060 SHELVE unaffected", "Stopped fusion-isolation patching after two confounded attempts"], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "claude-sonnet5-lead-20260921", "author_model": ""}');
INSERT INTO orch_turns(n, project_id, track_id, ts, summary, status, done, next, blockers, decisions, knowledge, author_agent, author_model, raw) VALUES(1278, 'p-7719544617', 't-d1cf43b723', '2026-09-23T05:54:32.263Z', 'Deep tick: P1 dose search in progress. N=3 survived clean (9903/12288 MiB). N=5 loaded tight (11805/12288 MiB, ~483MB headroom) and is mid-prefill, healthy, no anomaly, ~44% through 14K-token prompt. Sent architect a status consult (no blocker). No summarizer spawn per LOCAL OVERRIDE (no Paseo agent spawns).', 'running', '["N=3 dose probe confirmed SURVIVED with comfortable VRAM margin", "N=5 dose probe loaded and mid-prefill, healthy"]', '["Wait for N=5 to finish decode and log result", "Run N=6 dose probe to bound the ceiling", "Pre-register and run P1 A/B (best static -ot dose vs --moe-expert-cache-size 42)", "Report P1-before completion to architect on a deep tick to open BIOS reboot window"]', '[]', '[]', '{"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}', 'leader', 'claude-sonnet-5', '{"n": 1278, "ts": "2026-09-23T05:54:32.263Z", "summary": "Deep tick: P1 dose search in progress. N=3 survived clean (9903/12288 MiB). N=5 loaded tight (11805/12288 MiB, ~483MB headroom) and is mid-prefill, healthy, no anomaly, ~44% through 14K-token prompt. Sent architect a status consult (no blocker). No summarizer spawn per LOCAL OVERRIDE (no Paseo agent spawns).", "status": "running", "done": ["N=3 dose probe confirmed SURVIVED with comfortable VRAM margin", "N=5 dose probe loaded and mid-prefill, healthy"], "next": ["Wait for N=5 to finish decode and log result", "Run N=6 dose probe to bound the ceiling", "Pre-register and run P1 A/B (best static -ot dose vs --moe-expert-cache-size 42)", "Report P1-before completion to architect on a deep tick to open BIOS reboot window"], "blockers": [], "decisions": [], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "leader", "author_model": "claude-sonnet-5"}');
