patched for merge+build"], "next": ["Await dev agent completion (Colibri merge+build)", "Run Gate 1 (OFF-parity, mmap baselines) and Gate 2 (ON smoke, concurrent-both) on rig", "Then task-6becca4365 atlas sweeps (3060 first)"], "blockers": [], "decisions": [], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "leader", "author_model": "claude-sonnet-5"}');
