working tree, no data lost, transparently disclosed.", "status": "running", "done": [], "next": ["Await architect reply on the proposed getter fix", "Dispatch dev agent to apply fix + rebuild once confirmed", "Then run Gate 1/2 on rig"], "blockers": ["task-207401ba40 build failure: get_gf_res_prev() undeclared, awaiting architect confirmation on proposed fix"], "decisions": [], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "leader", "author_model": "claude-sonnet-5"}');
INSERT INTO orch_turns(n, project_id, track_id, ts, summary, status, done, next, blockers, decisions, knowledge, author_agent, author_model, raw) VALUES(1296, 'p-7719544617', 't-d1cf43b723', '2026-09-23T09:30:21.361Z', 'Architect confirmed the get_gf_res_prev() fix (matches proposed patch exactly), root-caused to their own cherry-pick skipping upstream dependency 2f3fd0252/#28549 - not WIP code. Explicitly warned against porting upstream''s array-based version (different semantics, null-deref hazard). Resumed the dev agent with exact patch text + keep-going build flag to catch any further missing cross-lineage symbols in one pass. Gate 2 gets an added pre-decode /experts check per architect. task-207401ba40 back to running.', 'running', '["Architect confirmed fix + root cause", "Dispatched dev agent with exact patch spec"]', '["Await dev agent''s rebuild result", "If clean: run Gate 1 (mmap baselines) + Gate 2 (concurrent, incl. pre-decode /experts check) on rig", "If more missing symbols surface: relay to architect before patching further"]', '[]', '[]', '{"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}', 'leader', 'claude-sonnet-5', '{"n": 1296, "ts": "2026-09-23T09:30:21.361Z", "summary": "Architect confirmed the get_gf_res_prev() fix (matches proposed patch exactly), root-caused to their own cherry-pick skipping upstream dependency 2f3fd0252/#28549 - not WIP code. Explicitly warned against porting upstream''s array-based version (different semantics, null-deref hazard). Resumed the dev agent with exact patch text + keep-going build flag to catch any further missing cross-lineage symbols in one pass. Gate 2 gets an added pre-decode /experts check per architect. task-207401ba40 back to running.", "status": "running", "done": ["Architect confirmed fix + root cause", "Dispatched dev agent with exact patch spec"], "next": ["Await dev agent''s rebuild result", "If clean: run Gate 1 (mmap baselines) + Gate 2 (concurrent, incl. pre-decode /experts check) on rig", "If more missing symbols surface: relay to architect before patching further"], "blockers": [], "decisions": [], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "leader", "author_model": "claude-sonnet-5"}');
