letion, greedy params, 3 reps alternating)", "Gate1 rerun: FAIL - real output divergence + speed regression, not noise", "Dispatched Gate2 load_impl fix to dev agent, verified their split_no=0 deviation is correct", "Documented in design doc sec35, filed lesson colibri-off-parity-gate1-fails", "Escalated Gate1 FAIL to architect, dev agent told to hold rebuild"], "next": ["Await architect direction on Gate1 FAIL: blocks Gate2 build? blocks whole task? right diagnostic?", "Once resolved: either root-cause the extra-reader hypothesis or get architect''s alternative read", "Resume dev agent''s Gate2 rebuild once cleared"], "blockers": [], "decisions": [], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "claude-sonnet5-lead-20260921", "author_model": ""}');
