diness >480s (4.1GB pull) + llama crash-loop exit1 fast early-boot (~1/s); artifact chain OK (pulled_digest verified); step-4 unreached. Dev gathering read-only VM evidence (journal stderr+argv, port 8086 vs orphan pid 1723856 hypothesis, VRAM, dmesg) then architect routes; no piecemeal. Pending: ctx 128000->65536 amendment, OTEL label, #577 RPC, 480s assessment. Todos 5/10; rig window free (deploy VM-side).", "status": "running", "done": [], "next": [], "blockers": ["P2 deploy FAILED (readiness>480s + llama crash-loop exit1) - VM evidence in flight, architect ruling next; ctx 128000->65536 amendment pending", "EAN defect -> task-ff0e020578 owner; C1 deferred", "baseline/local 27B down (curl 000) - owner restart needed; fleet_recommend still ranks it top", "Parent MAIN push/PR owner-gated (feat bump e848cb563 pushed)", "/tmp/opencode 8.7GB owner decision (swap 68.54% vs 70%)", "Capture slots 2-3 queued - rig free now, releasing after P2 crash ruling"], "decisions": [], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "72cc5fbc-99b5-4eba-af00-5aa16b4c01d6", "author_model": ""}');
