te removal (models.json/workers.json) queued AFTER P2 gates - 7-day usage check first", "Capture slots 2-3 queued: collector after redeploy build leg, eb8be805 after collector"], "decisions": [], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "72cc5fbc-99b5-4eba-af00-5aa16b4c01d6", "author_model": ""}');
