mit, Validate required). rpc_disabled per-node, not global; emit only when set; Validate keeps loud engine error; mutual-exclusion error; warning line re P/D+KV. Tests 1-4 unit + test 5 real-config golden (merge global+amended node, argv excludes 7 flags, includes load-mode/ctx65536/draft-mtp/ubatch512x2/Ornith). Proof via host Go ~/go-sdk/go/bin: go test+build, test-5 argv -> local H3 parse-to-load. TWO commits (head patch; yaml rpc_disabled:true) FF push, gate=3 files, ONE deploy. Step-4 += verify VM head patched (deploy reuses bin/hydra-head - do not assume), journal no --rpc-port + has --load-mode none, warning present, no invalid config. Dev executing now (~160K, terse+respawn armed).", "status": "running", "done": [], "next": [], "blockers": ["P2 execution: head patch -> Go proof -> 2 commits -> deploy -> extended step-4 -> gates (dev ctx ~160K, respawn-on-cap armed)", "EAN defect -> task-ff0e020578 owner; C1 deferred; P2 envs EAN/CAPTURE OFF", "baseline/local 27B down (curl 000) - owner restart needed; fleet_recommend still ranks it top", "Parent MAIN push/PR owner-gated (feat bump e848cb563 pushed)", "/tmp/opencode 8.7GB owner decision (swap 68.54% vs 70%)", "Core-route removal queued AFTER P2 gates - 7-day usage check first", "Collector after deploy terminal, eb8be805 after collector; rig TIMING A/Bs gated off P100 bench windows"], "decisions": [], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "72cc5fbc-99b5-4eba-af00-5aa16b4c01d6", "author_model": ""}');
