S-REQUESTED, do not merge. Blockers: B1 Gitleaks FP (c13.txt:83, allowlist only - later corrected to .gitleaksignore fingerprint from run 35954850877 log, redaction will not clear range scan), B2 scope bloat 100 commits/131 files/240K lines w/ 220K generated tools/atlas/out JSON + 2 stray root files - option (b) chosen over split (interleaved history, architect accepted with conditions), B3 PORTS_AND_ENV P100 row wrong (retired service + :9502 -> Head-managed :8086 no RPC). Architect conditions: retitle PR as honest epic->main scope (atlas-web, moe-controls, llama-baseline, docs, P100 chain), squash-merge-vs-merge-commit as explicit owner merge-time choice in body, record CI runner identity in management log. Fix dev ba66ceb3 spawned with full review + amendments; N1-N7 nits included. Architect re-review after fixes + CI green; merge needs explicit owner. Also surfaced owner: BIOS reboot (3060 PCIe) + MTP A/B P100 (acceptance 0.30-0.36) questions + claude.ai connector auth.", "status": "running", "done": [], "next": [], "blockers": ["Host swap nominal 66.81 pct, transient ~100 pct spikes under capture57 - avail 44.7Gi falling; monitoring STAGE 1 (loki/prom/grafana) starting, STAGE 2 Langfuse HELD until arms done ~11:45", "r3 held pending GO after eb8be805 5060Ti yield ~05:20 UTC", "EAN Phase-1 authoring in flight (P1 dev, root cause line-exact: unary.cu:144 contiguity assert, graph-side cont fix); push/CI/smoke BLOCKED on arms", "PR #800 fixes in flight (dev ba66ceb3); owner pending: BIOS reboot question, MTP A/B question, claude.ai connector auth"], "decisions": [], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "72cc5fbc-99b5-4eba-af00-5aa16b4c01d6", "author_model": ""}');
INSERT INTO orch_turns(n, project_id, track_id, ts, summary, status, done, next, blockers, decisions, knowledge, author_agent, author_model, raw) VALUES(1346, 'p-7719544617', 't-d1cf43b723', '2026-09-24T04:37:38.701Z', 'Owner request (via architect): P100 Ornith model not visible in OMP picker - spawned diag dev to test causes in order (process-start-before-10:34, models.db cache stale, wrong instance/provider-hidden), fix per cause WITHOUT touching owner sessions, end-to-end proof = fresh OMP session picks p100/ornith-1.5-35b, short prompt, hit confirmed in Head-spawned llama-server log via hydra-p100 ssh (or turns-counter delta), no API keys echoed, backups before edits. Also: stray bifrost id p100//mnt/readonly_data/...gguf = cosmetic cleanup item, remove only if routing-safe. Architect verified old hydra-atlas-engine.service inactive+disabled (keep as rollback, stays down), only flash-next on :8086, nothing on :9502. Prior turn 1345: PR800 CHANGES-REQUESTED + fix dev ba66ceb3 with architect amendments (honest epic->main retitle, squash-merge owner choice, gitleaksignore fingerprint, runner identity recording).', 'running', '[]', '[]', '["Host swap nominal 66.81 pct, avail 44.7Gi falling; monitoring STAGE 1 light trio starting, STAGE 2 Langfuse HELD until capture57 arms (~11:45 UTC)", "r3 held pending GO after eb8be805 5060Ti yield ~05:20 UTC", "EAN Phase-1 authoring in flight (P1 dev); build/CI/smoke BLOCKED on arms", "PR #800 fixes in flight (ba66ceb3); OMP visibility diag in flight (new dev); owner pending: BIOS reboot + MTP A/B questions, claude.ai connector auth"]', '[]', '{"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}', '72cc5fbc-99b5-4eba-af00-5aa16b4c01d6', '', '{"n": 1346, "ts": "2026-09-24T04:37:38.701Z", "summary": "Owner request (via architect): P100 Ornith model not visible in OMP picker - spawned diag dev to test causes in order (process-start-before-10:34, models.db cache stale, wrong instance/provider-hidden), fix per cause WITHOUT touching owner sessions, end-to-end proof = fresh OMP session picks p100/ornith-1.5-35b, short prompt, hit confirmed in Head-spawned llama-server log via hydra-p100 ssh (or turns-counter delta), no API keys echoed, backups before edits. Also: stray bifrost id p100//mnt/readonly_data/...gguf = cosmetic cleanup item, remove only if routing-safe. Architect verified old hydra-atlas-engine.service inactive+disabled (keep as rollback, stays down), only flash-next on :8086, nothing on :9502. Prior turn 1345: PR800 CHANGES-REQUESTED + fix dev ba66ceb3 with architect amendments (honest epic->main retitle, squash-merge owner choice, gitleaksignore fingerprint, runner identity recording).", "status": "running", "done": [], "next": [], "blockers": ["Host swap nominal 66.81 pct, avail 44.7Gi falling; monitoring STAGE 1 light trio starting, STAGE 2 Langfuse HELD until capture57 arms (~11:45 UTC)", "r3 held pending GO after eb8be805 5060Ti yield ~05:20 UTC", "EAN Phase-1 authoring in flight (P1 dev); build/CI/smoke BLOCKED on arms", "PR #800 fixes in flight (ba66ceb3); OMP visibility diag in flight (new dev); owner pending: BIOS reboot + MTP A/B questions, claude.ai connector auth"], "decisions": [], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "72cc5fbc-99b5-4eba-af00-5aa16b4c01d6", "author_model": ""}');
INSERT INTO orch_turns(n, project_id, track_id, ts, summary, status, done, next, blockers, decisions, knowledge, author_agent, author_model, raw) VALUES(1347, 'p-7719544617', 't-d1cf43b723', '2026-09-24T04:39:12.421Z', 'Monitoring Stage 1 HARD ABORT at Prometheus pre-start: swap 69.38->74->77 pct monotonic ~4pp/min under capture57 dual arms - LOCKED owner guard <70 pct is actively breached; Loki had started HEALTHY (3100/ready gate green, plain documented start, zero config edits) then stopped cleanly by cleanup; zero net state, Stage 2 held, all monitoring ON HOLD until I send stage-1 GO with fresh sample swap<69.5+avail>=42 (earliest after 5060Ti arm ~05:20 UTC, maybe till 3060 ~11:45). ROOT CAUSES landed: :9090 ghost since Sep-14 = system cockpit.socket (active since 09-14 10:44, 10s before unit failures) - port ruling issued: Prometheus on docs :9091, cockpit NOT touched (owner approval needed for any system-service stop), documented deviation for report; Grafana datasource 9090-vs-9091 read-only check ordered; unit rot = journal rotation only (09-14 verbatim unrecoverable, prereqs green, plain start works - no repair needed). OMP visibility diag + PR800 fixes + EAN authoring all in flight. Swap breach flag to owner: captures pre-authorized, not killing them; monitoring deferred to protect guard.', 'running', '[]', '[]', '["LOCKED swap guard <70 pct BREACHED live: 77 pct at 04:37 UTC, capture57-owned, trending; monitoring all starts held until clean sample", "r3 held pending GO after eb8be805 5060Ti yield ~05:20 UTC", "EAN Phase-1 authoring in flight (P1 dev); build/CI/smoke BLOCKED on arms", "PR #800 fixes (ba66ceb3) + OMP visibility diag (c9ab8cb7) in flight; owner pending: BIOS reboot + MTP A/B, claude.ai connectors, :9090 cockpit decision"]', '[]', '{"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}', '72cc5fbc-99b5-4eba-af00-5aa16b4c01d6', '', '{"n": 1347, "ts": "2026-09-24T04:39:12.421Z", "summary": "Monitoring Stage 1 HARD ABORT at Prometheus pre-start: swap 69.38->74->77 pct monotonic ~4pp/min under capture57 dual arms - LOCKED owner guard <70 pct is actively breached; Loki had started HEALTHY (3100/ready gate green, plain documented start, zero config edits) then stopped cleanly by cleanup; zero net state, Stage 2 held, all monitoring ON HOLD until I send stage-1 GO with fresh sample swap<69.5+avail>=42 (earliest after 5060Ti arm ~05:20 UTC, maybe till 3060 ~11:45). ROOT CAUSES landed: :9090 ghost since Sep-14 = system cockpit.socket (active since 09-14 10:44, 10s before unit failures) - port ruling issued: Prometheus on docs :9091, cockpit NOT touched (owner approval needed for any system-service stop), documented deviation for report; Grafana datasource 9090-vs-9091 read-only check ordered; unit rot = journal rotation only (09-14 verbatim unrecoverable, prereqs green, plain start works - no repair needed). OMP visibility diag + PR800 fixes + EAN authoring all in flight. Swap breach flag to owner: captures pre-authorized, not killing them; monitoring deferred to protect guard.", "status": "running", "done": [], "next": [], "blockers": ["LOCKED swap guard <70 pct BREACHED live: 77 pct at 04:37 UTC, capture57-owned, trending; monitoring all starts held until clean sample", "r3 held pending GO after eb8be805 5060Ti yield ~05:20 UTC", "EAN Phase-1 authoring in flight (P1 dev); build/CI/smoke BLOCKED on arms", "PR #800 fixes (ba66ceb3) + OMP visibility diag (c9ab8cb7) in flight; owner pending: BIOS reboot + MTP A/B, claude.ai connectors, :9090 cockpit decision"], "decisions": [], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "72cc5fbc-99b5-4eba-af00-5aa16b4c01d6", "author_model": ""}');
