ssert (awk-verified); sumrows.cu:27 next; k=1 contiguous = why trivial paths passed. Fix = graph-side ggml_cont at llama-graph.cpp:2479 inside HYDRA_EAN_STATS guard (OFF byte-identical; kernel stride = band-aid + merge cost; sqr-full-then-slice rejected, sum_rows would still assert). reset() wired at both boundaries: /capture/flush probe-end (design 36/86/63-64) + /capture/reset gate broadened capture||stats||ean; capture_reset() removed (clean cutover). 4 test groups authored (reset fresh-window bit-equal + flush, OFF absent, decode-only + guards + speculative, C++ graph pin). Diffstat 7 files +377/-19. EAN todos 2/4; push/CI/smoke BLOCKED on both arms.", "status": "running", "done": [], "next": [], "blockers": ["Swap guard <70 pct BREACHED live (82.6 pct 04:39, capture-owned) - monitoring held until clean sample, earliest after 5060Ti arm ~05:20 UTC", "r3 held pending GO after eb8be805 5060Ti yield ~05:20 UTC", "EAN push/CI/smoke BLOCKED on both arms (todos 3-4)", "PR800 fixes (ba66ceb3) + OMP visibility (c9ab8cb7) in flight; owner pending: BIOS reboot, MTP A/B, cockpit :9090 OK, claude.ai connectors"], "decisions": [], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "72cc5fbc-99b5-4eba-af00-5aa16b4c01d6", "author_model": ""}');
