ays + handoff-state.md, out/ gitignored, PROJECT_STATUS audited 0 overlap; B3 PORTS_AND_ENV = head-managed :8086 no RPC. Architect conditions all in: honest epic->main retitle + body (atlas-web, moe-controls, llama-baseline, docs, P100 chain), squash-merge-vs-merge-commit owner choice in body. N1 deleted 3 moe-35b-pd* entries (Count asserts are workers.json - 586/586 green); N2-N6 done (N3 digest-authority comment, no 40-char tag exists). VERIFIED: json.tool, dotnet 586/586, go ok, local gitleaks clean. RUNNER IDENTITY recorded: Build&Test ubuntu-latest GitHub CLOUD (runnerName null, cloud-first resolve-runner) - pushes during captures do not contend host. Re-review requested from architect (whole epic scope).", "status": "running", "done": [], "next": [], "blockers": ["Swap guard <70 BREACHED live (82.6 pct, capture-owned) - monitoring held to clean sample; earliest after 5060Ti arm ~05:20 UTC", "r3 held pending eb8be805 5060Ti yield ~05:20 UTC", "EAN push/CI/smoke BLOCKED on both arms (todos 3-4)", "Architect re-review of 9a8e41729 in flight; OMP visibility (c9ab8cb7) in flight; owner pending: BIOS, MTP A/B, cockpit :9090, claude.ai connectors"], "decisions": [], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "72cc5fbc-99b5-4eba-af00-5aa16b4c01d6", "author_model": ""}');
