t a VRAM match is not a throughput datapoint, and the gate needs throughput. 8K row stays banked (+18.6%; 1.321 -> 1.567); MTP stays characterised (host_ops 1728 vs 0, 2.04x). The three pre-registered 80K outcomes are unchanged and binding: tie persists => residency exhausted at serving depth; N=42 wins => extend the ladder; 80K will not fit => report per-cell cost.", "status": "running", "done": ["Worker resumed; d32k-n42-nomtp LOAD_OK at 8855 MiB, rig at 34% util", "Declined to report a result - no PROBE lines yet", "Gate and three pre-registered outcomes held unchanged; summary write still deferred to avoid stomping t-f3ba82ac9c"], "next": ["Await the 32K decode number, then 32K N=28, then 80K from the N the model predicts fits", "OWNER: MTP 2.04x; re-open d-255055e394; merge #808+#159"], "blockers": [], "decisions": [], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "8c8a2d29-8e85-4096-a51a-cba0b42111f4", "author_model": "opencode-go/space-bunny-free"}');
