. LADDER-SUM TESTS: GT-laddersum-overflows ctx=40960 target=20000, rungs=[3000,5300,8980,14868,20000] NAIVE SUM 52,148 > 40,960 - max request sent 19,935, rc=0, PASS, so the 52k send is now structurally impossible. GT-laddersum-target-nofit, same shape target 40700 - REFUSED, max sent none, rc=4, PASS. Suite 7 passed 0 failed; GT-over-cap and GT-legal-32k kept as unit tests, not cited as the integration proof. Live cell shows REQ_PREDICT step=1 SENDING request_tokens_pred=3000 headroom_pred=37896 OK - gate runs BEFORE the send. STALE SERVERS pids 2973566 and 2982228 killed; rig verified 0, 1 MiB / 0% both before relaunch. 32K row relaunched, d32k-n42 in flight. No decode number yet, none claimed.", "status": "running", "done": [], "next": [], "blockers": [], "decisions": [], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "6a24a038-c371-4830-9b2a-84a8a55f1289", "author_model": "opencode-go/space-bunny-free"}');
