 3.937 then 3.851, 2% drift, vs the broken 3.937/2.412/3.331. A pre-send gate announces headroom_pred BEFORE the request, so refusal precedes launch instead of following a 400. Cell live at step 3 of 5, DRAFT_ACCEPT none-yet - still NO decode number. First real PROBE near 08:15.", "status": "running", "done": ["Delta fix live: step 2 words 596 (= 2347/3.937, exactly the gap) vs 1346 before; cumulative 5248 vs a 5300 rung where the broken build sent 6199", "Bug eight fixed: line 250 appends target, LADDER contains 32000 vs the broken generator capping at 24288", "Ratio vindicated: 3.937 -> 3.851 is 2% drift, so the 39% swing was the wrong divisor", "Pre-send gate present: headroom_pred is announced before the request"], "next": ["Hold for the first real PROBE with real N near 08:15"], "blockers": [], "decisions": [], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "8c8a2d29-8e85-4096-a51a-cba0b42111f4", "author_model": "opencode-go/space-bunny-free"}');
