om the control path, and emit FINAL_CUMULATIVE with PASS/FAIL. HELD: still no decode number; 8K PASS +18.6%; MTP 2.04x; three 80K outcomes binding.", "status": "running", "done": ["Retracted my own ''ratio was never unstable'' claim: series 3.937, 3.851, 2.072, step 3 under-delivers ~49%, cumulative 7256 vs an 8980 rung", "Sent three directives: target-driven loop, remove the ratio from the control path, emit FINAL_CUMULATIVE with PASS/FAIL"], "next": ["Worker: target-driven loop, drop the ratio from control, announce FINAL_CUMULATIVE, relaunch; a 32K label on a 7.2K measurement is unacceptable"], "blockers": [], "decisions": [], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "8c8a2d29-8e85-4096-a51a-cba0b42111f4", "author_model": "opencode-go/space-bunny-free"}');
