or. HOUSEKEEPING 1 DONE: result-d80k-n42-B.txt annotated IN PLACE stating there is NO 80K DECODE NUMBER in it and that FINAL_CUMULATIVE 80008 PASS IS real, then RENAMED so the name carries the verdict - out/SUPERSEDED-d80k-n42-B-probe-failed-PROBES_DONE-untrue.txt, copy at VOID-d80k-n42-B-probe-failed.txt. Kept, not deleted, being the only 80K prefill evidence. HOUSEKEEPING 2 DONE: the rule is IN THE FILE at BOTH except blocks. PARSE_GATE 3 blocks 0 failed. STEP 1 IN FLIGHT: d32k-n28-new to pair with 1.6129. QUEUED: d80k-n42-C, ctx 106496, N=42, target 80000, nothing reduced. 80K N=28 NOT started without asking.", "status": "running", "done": [], "next": [], "blockers": [], "decisions": [], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "6a24a038-c371-4830-9b2a-84a8a55f1289", "author_model": "opencode-go/space-bunny-free"}');
