th-%d rule now at both except blocks, noting PARSE_GATE cannot enforce it"], "next": ["Worker: report the new-lineage 32K gap from d32k-n28-new against 1.6129, then d80k-n42-C", "Owner pending: one-flag n_ubatch chunk test, or hold for 80K"], "blockers": [], "decisions": [], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "8c8a2d29-8e85-4096-a51a-cba0b42111f4", "author_model": "opencode-go/space-bunny-free"}');
