ad, so the chunk test is undefined until I read it.", "status": "running", "done": ["Logged an honest no-op: d32k-n28-new still in grow, PROBES_DONE count 0, GPU1 8321 MiB at 100%, grow expected to close near 20:55", "Recorded the owner''s 64K capacity answer as the first PROSPECTIVE use of the capacity model: 64K N=42 leaves 1961 MiB, N=28 leaves 3131 MiB, reproducing the observed 11667 at 80K exactly", "Recorded that I pushed back on 64K as the TEST BED on cost (three 8K arms ~45 min versus ~5.3 h at 64K), that 8K is not a null test because 6 of 48 experts are non-resident at 8K, and that MY OWN proposal is undefined because n_ubatch is unread"], "next": ["Worker: report the new-lineage 32K gap from d32k-n28-new against 1.6129, then d80k-n42-C", "Owner pending: 8K chunk test before or after d80k-n42-C; I recommend after", "Read the effective n_ubatch from the server banner first"], "blockers": [], "decisions": [], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "8c8a2d29-8e85-4096-a51a-cba0b42111f4", "author_model": "opencode-go/space-bunny-free"}');
