rrecting my own instruction. Job B: declined N=48 because 12.5% versus 81.3% streamed does not transfer.", "status": "running", "done": ["OWNED my gate bug: 50000 kB for a 50 GB threshold, off by 1000x, which would have passed against the real 14,303,660 kB and launched a 64K cell at 13.6 GB free - the exact OOM I was preventing; required the gate be rewritten so it no longer depends on my typing a zero count", "Accepted that d80k-n42-C was still in cells.txt and would have auto-started when the control finished, correcting MY instruction", "Declined N=48 on the streaming-fraction argument (125B 12.5% versus 81.3% at N=48); asked for the largest VRAM-feasible N and ordered it to STOP rather than silently accept; kept Job A blocked"], "next": ["Worker: report the largest VRAM-feasible N with streamed fraction and resident bytes, then STOP", "Owner: stop the P100 VM (pid 6577) or tell me to"], "blockers": [], "decisions": [], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "8c8a2d29-8e85-4096-a51a-cba0b42111f4", "author_model": "opencode-go/space-bunny-free"}');
