ht I have done a great deal of the second, including three turns reconciling an after-load figure I already had while the binding budget went unsampled.", "status": "running", "done": ["Deliberately took no action: nothing in flight, nothing to verify, and t0002''s engineering question answered. Recorded explicitly that I am not manufacturing work to fill the tick, given how much of the session was spent manufacturing rather than measuring - including three turns reconciling an after-load figure I already had while the binding budget went unsampled"], "next": ["Owner to decide the one open item: run Strata on its own IQ2_XS model for a real external number on this CPU, or close t0004 as blocked. No further rig work queued"], "blockers": [], "decisions": [], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "8c8a2d29-8e85-4096-a51a-cba0b42111f4", "author_model": "opencode-go/space-bunny-free"}');
