ls this generation; turn_report used as the confirm and report path, track ids discovered from the local state dir. NO digest written, NO leader messaged on this wake.", "status": "running", "done": [], "next": ["Read track_status.orchestrator.wakes_remaining NOW that the generation is confirmed, and follow it verbatim.", "wakes_remaining>1 => narrow poll only; wakes_remaining==1 => full collection, digest, escalation, then self-archive."], "blockers": [], "decisions": [], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "263111fc-cbb6-45ff-8017-5466505b3a06", "author_model": "opencode-go/space-bunny-free"}');
