workspace_id is set and live PROD sets it for no position, so nothing was checked and no tool reads caveats. Every auto_accept slot now carries ensure_scoped_workspace (PRE; else strip settings.features, never grant) and verify_scoped_workspace (POST; else leader-issued auto_accept=false, escalate), both executor=leader, named in runbook/SKILL/reference. H2: requireApproval = ACP/freebuff documented, UNVERIFIED for opencode. H3: fixed the SOURCES; sync-agents.py = ZERO diff; legacy full copy listed as follow-up, sweep NOT claimed clean. MED1: substring denylist -> ALLOWLIST. MED2: malformed spawn now fails closed (previously GRANTED). MED3: top-level spawn.auto_permission now the fleet-wide default. H5 fixed. Suite 339 -> 359 passed / 8 skipped, 20 tests RED first.", "status": "idle", "done": [], "next": ["QA round 3 re-review on #67; no merge/rebase. Restart the :8098 backend after this round (runs 9200617).", "#65 merges first, then renumber d-41 -> d-43+.", "FOLLOW-UP: .opencode/prompts/lead.txt is a legacy FULL contract copy generated by nothing, stale beyond auto-permission. Only its auto-permission line fixed here."], "blockers": [], "decisions": ["Owner directive 2026-09-30 (d-128675d1d0): ''Update contract when leader dispatches subagent: ensure auto-allow permission.''", "Leader 2026-09-30: create-time auto_accept IS effective for a leader->subagent create, so the primary mechanism is not weakened."], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "65e83af1-32a3-4202-b817-164330bd3cf3", "author_model": "opencode-go/space-bunny-free"}');
