er 720c24ff45 LACKS e906bb390 (plugin dialog location) — config-only enable would fail; fresh env build required", "Web UI already current on shared Caddy :6969 (index-297296bd) — no web deploy needed for PROD", "PROD config.json backed up (config.json.bak-trajectory-20260930) + trajectory plugin entry added (worktree path, enabled), pluginsEnabled=true", "Task task-d016b3194a queued"], "next": ["Trigger pipeline (build + deploy-prod); restart will drop all active agents incl. leader — owner informed", "Post-restart: verify :6767 health, plugin loaded in PROD daemon.log, trajectory header button works via :6969", "Report results to owner"], "blockers": [], "decisions": ["PROD deploy scope: trajectory plugin only (owner wording); ctx-inject offered as follow-up opt-in", "Deploy source = env feat/freebuff-plugin (53692f4fd) via run_build_hydra + run_deploy_prod; TEST daemon untouched"], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "64b0b20e-2a1e-4759-b87e-9c3ea56b67cb", "author_model": ""}');
