INSERT INTO orch_turns(n, project_id, track_id, ts, summary, status, done, next, blockers, decisions, knowledge, author_agent, author_model, raw) VALUES(140, 'p-b5bd663dcf', 't-62504d3c56', '2026-09-30T15:00:22.022Z', 'Phase 1 design note at scratch/laneH/design.md (387+ lines). No product code written. A ctx source = get_agent_status -> snapshot.lastUsage.contextWindowUsedTokens ONLY (list_agents has no token field; window is 1048576, so 200K is ABSOLUTE ~19%, not a fraction); stale after compaction until next model turn. B compaction = send /compact (or /summarize); live-proved 95321 -> 58557 used tokens, cached 77297 -> 113. Count is NOT readable from activity lines: one compaction renders TWO [Compacted] because the curator ignores status (activity-curator.ts:186-188). C1 rules R1-R5 with W1/W2/W3 wrong-direction signals; leader decides, collector only informs. C2 reuses existing suggestion_add (registry stays 26; needs ALLOWED_KINDS += oversize, suggestions.py:26); suggestion_review is already leader-gated. C3 GAP: no harness auto-permits today (catalog.py:284-291 never emits settings/features). BLOCKER: PR #67 looks like a NO-OP - settings.features.auto_accept stays false live; paseo reads top-level features (create-agent/create.ts:91,401). omp/claude only need an existing set_mode step. COLLISION: agent 0572c64 ''dev H1: contract text'' is running in MY worktree and already wrote my PR-1 contract edits; I committed/reverted nothing.', 'idle', '["A: ctx source verified per harness (opencode-agent.ts:938-951); reliable for idle, stale across compaction", "B: /compact trigger + measured drop verified live on throwaway 4c426290, then archived", "B: 2x compaction over-count hazard identified and root-caused", "C1: contract numbers R1-R5 + 6 surfaces enumerated", "C2: ctx watch design reuses suggestion_add; registry verified =26 (server.py:172-190)", "C3: per-harness auto-permission gap table verified live", "D: 8 risks, 8 red-first tests, 4-PR phase-2 split", "Design note written to scratch/laneH/design.md"]', '["Owner answers Q1-Q7 in design.md (Q2 absolute-vs-fraction is load-bearing)", "Leader re-bases phase 2: H1 owns PR-1 contract text, H2 likely owns collector", "Decide Q6: open defect on PR #67 opencode emission before layering PR-2", "Give H1/H2 separate worktrees per shared-worktree.md:7-9"]', '["WORKTREE COLLISION: agent 0572c640 ''dev H1: contract text'' shares my worktree and is actively editing the same 9 files; shared-worktree.md:7-9 warns whole-file git add sweeps a co-worker''s WIP", "PR #67 may not satisfy owner directive #4: live test shows settings.features.auto_accept is ignored (value stays false); root cause create-agent/create.ts:91,401 reads top-level features"]', '["Thresholds are absolute tokens (200K of a 1M window), not a fraction - window verified at 1048576", "Collector detects and informs via existing suggestion_add; never kills/archives/compacts - enforced by leader-only gate at suggestions.py:218-225", "Do not bump CONTRACT_MIN_VERSION (config.py:249) - it is the leader_register gate and forces a 3-way lockstep with DESIGN.md:101"]', '{"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}', '5af12723-14a6-4f16-9ffc-5b82e3f070d8', 'opencode-go/space-bunny-free', '{"n": 140, "ts": "2026-09-30T15:00:22.022Z", "summary": "Phase 1 design note at scratch/laneH/design.md (387+ lines). No product code written. A ctx source = get_agent_status -> snapshot.lastUsage.contextWindowUsedTokens ONLY (list_agents has no token field; window is 1048576, so 200K is ABSOLUTE ~19%, not a fraction); stale after compaction until next model turn. B compaction = send /compact (or /summarize); live-proved 95321 -> 58557 used tokens, cached 77297 -> 113. Count is NOT readable from activity lines: one compaction renders TWO [Compacted] because the curator ignores status (activity-curator.ts:186-188). C1 rules R1-R5 with W1/W2/W3 wrong-direction signals; leader decides, collector only informs. C2 reuses existing suggestion_add (regis