ever deployed web)", "paseo-test restarted 00:16, trajectory plugin Loaded+ready; QC r18 dispatched (task-e656eee25d) for full 8-item pass"], "next": ["Await QC r18 verdict", "If PASS: report to owner with evidence for review; PROD web refresh = automatic (shared Caddy), PROD daemon restart NOT needed (no server changes)", "If FAIL: fix loop via dev"], "blockers": [], "decisions": [], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "64b0b20e-2a1e-4759-b87e-9c3ea56b67cb", "author_model": ""}');
INSERT INTO orch_turns(n, project_id, track_id, ts, summary, status, done, next, blockers, decisions, knowledge, author_agent, author_model, raw) VALUES(149, 'p-b5bd663dcf', 't-62504d3c56', '2026-09-30T17:18:04.309Z', 'Owner report-format directive deployed + verified live. Prompt v3 (9499B): (1) OUTPUT FORMAT — every turn first line [#orchestrator] {local time +07} ({delta} since last run), only two permitted clock derivations from server fields (now, heartbeat lastRunAt/generation_started_at); (2) narrow poll output = roster list one line per track (id — epic/title — last turn Ns) + single-anomaly drill-down table rule; (3) final-wake digest = per ACTIVE track a ### {id} — {title} block with | agent | role | task | progress | table (workers joined to tasks by assignee) + Summary line + structured fields. thinkingOptionId=default->minimal on BOTH schedules (valid OMP level Light-reasoning; opencode accepted it — run succeeded); paseo MCP update_schedule silently DROPS unknown fields (thinkingOptionId not in wrapper schema) — set via DaemonClient wire instead; fleet orchestrator position already carries omp+opencode models. Verified: PROD run-once e9f6f0cf output STARTS [#orchestrator] 2026-10-01 00:17 (+1m) then 8-track roster; tests 71 green; commits: prompt format.', 'idle', '[]', '[]', '[]', '[]', '{"lesson_topic": "paseo MCP wrapper schemas silently drop unknown params — wire-level fields need DaemonClient; verify by reading the schedule back", "docs_updated": []}', '4774f61c-0dca-4331-9a91-46e0ee32b238', 'opencode-go/mimo-v2.6-flash', '{"n": 149, "ts": "2026-09-30T17:18:04.309Z", "summary": "Owner report-format directive deployed + verified live. Prompt v3 (9499B): (1) OUTPUT FORMAT — every turn first line [#orchestrator] {local time +07} ({delta} since last run), only two permitted clock derivations from server fields (now, heartbeat lastRunAt/generation_started_at); (2) narrow poll output = roster list one line per track (id — epic/title — last turn Ns) + single-anomaly drill-down table rule; (3) final-wake digest = per ACTIVE track a ### {id} — {title} block with | agent | role | task | progress | table (workers joined to tasks by assignee) + Summary line + structured fields. thinkingOptionId=default->minimal on BOTH schedules (valid OMP level Light-reasoning; opencode accepted it — run succeeded); paseo MCP update_schedule silently DROPS unknown fields (thinkingOptionId not in wrapper schema) — set via DaemonClient wire instead; fleet orchestrator position already carries omp+opencode models. Verified: PROD run-once e9f6f0cf output STARTS [#orchestrator] 2026-10-01 00:17 (+1m) then 8-track roster; tests 71 green; commits: prompt format.", "status": "idle", "done": [], "next": [], "blockers": [], "decisions": [], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": "paseo MCP wrapper schemas silently drop unknown params — wire-level fields need DaemonClient; verify by reading the schedule back", "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "4774f61c-0dca-4331-9a91-46e0ee32b238", "author_model": "opencode-go/mimo-v2.6-flash"}');
