nomaly itself), cross-join agent->task->track leader; REPORT TIMING: agent anomalies escalate IMMEDIATELY via paseo_send_agent_prompt on first detection (deduped), track health stays final-wake; detect+inform only. Narrow poll output now = header + roster + per-agent ctx line. LIVE-VERIFIED PROD run 8340ba33: header exact, AGENT WATCH ran (own ctx 54,632 baseline, band OK, zero sends justified), system track skipped, honest not-verified-none-exist distinction. Tests 89 green (fixed lines/2 fleet-id false positive). H2 task -> running 60%.", "status": "idle", "done": [], "next": [], "blockers": [], "decisions": [], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": "agent evidence vs system claims: ctx lives only on get_agent_status (list_agents has none); prompt arithmetic literals trip the fleet-id guard — phrase ratios in words", "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "4774f61c-0dca-4331-9a91-46e0ee32b238", "author_model": "opencode-go/mimo-v2.6-flash"}');
