list still unserved = task B). Observation to carry: it flagged 4 generations born in 27 min — 3 of those are TONIGHTS manual renewals (17:15/17:24/17:27 mine + 17:00 cron), not organic death; but 642c6f3d shows no wake after its 17:24 heartbeat due — worth checking heartbeat delivery on next tick. 13 idle collector sessions + 3 orphan checkups = cleanup backlog (owner/creator).", "status": "idle", "done": [], "next": [], "blockers": [], "decisions": [], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": "idle between 8-min wakes is normal, not death — distinguish run-ends (first turn) from generation-ends before claiming churn", "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "4774f61c-0dca-4331-9a91-46e0ee32b238", "author_model": "opencode-go/mimo-v2.6-flash"}');
