tact); #64 CONDITIONAL PASS as stack bottom only (still carries B1/B2/B3/B5 resolve_since edge defects, fixed downstream in #66 -> must land WITH #66); MINOR: d-41/d-42 collide with #65 merged ids -> renumber at stack landing. Architect (aea2b9f8, turn-recorded n156): #64 CLEAN for stated defect class, #66 CLEAN + decisions-cap risk (owner bless pending). D: PR ddvnguyen/paseo#33 (ci/pnpm-install, 35bcedf27) — 14 install steps to pnpm route + ci-paths routing fix + .npmrc store-dir fix; PROVEN on real CI run 36797287666 (0 jobs die at setup-node, was 17/18); second breakage found+fixed (.npmrc absolute store path = EACCES on runners); surfaced post-gate failures (format/lint/typecheck/relay/sdk jiti) as pre-existing debt — store-dir hunk awaits owner nod; #32 CI-green now depends on #33 + main suite.", "status": "idle", "done": [], "next": [], "blockers": ["TEST collector boot blocked at step 1 — paseo tools never injected on TEST daemon (task-12f20731ef); PROD boots fine — plus orphan heartbeats 08c2b0ba/7e0a1707 and 13 idle collector sessions await creator/owner cleanup"], "decisions": [], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": "zero GitHub reviews means the track ledger IS the review record — recover findings from worker reports before re-reviewing", "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "4774f61c-0dca-4331-9a91-46e0ee32b238", "author_model": "opencode-go/mimo-v2.6-flash"}');
