 = owner: merge order (now incl #69), store-dir nod (#33), decisions-cap bless (#66), PROD #29 daemon restart, H2 go; 05:00Z renewal = first v6 generation. Summary rebuild + OKF to follow in this tick.", "status": "idle", "done": [], "next": [], "blockers": ["TEST collector boot blocked at step 1 — paseo tools never injected on TEST daemon (task-12f20731ef); PROD boots fine — plus orphan heartbeats 08c2b0ba/7e0a1707 and 13 idle collector sessions await creator/owner cleanup"], "decisions": [], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": "when both reviews land, close the worker task the same tick — exit-criteria tracking is the leader''s bookkeeping, not the worker''s", "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "4774f61c-0dca-4331-9a91-46e0ee32b238", "author_model": "opencode-go/mimo-v2.6-flash"}');
