e": {"lesson_topic": "a fix in the prompt reaches the NEXT generation, not the live one — track which generation carries the old contract until rotation", "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "4774f61c-0dca-4331-9a91-46e0ee32b238", "author_model": "opencode-go/mimo-v2.6-flash"}');
