g discipline, renewal 17:00Z (first maxRuns48 gen), TEST retest after restart.", "status": "idle", "done": [], "next": [], "blockers": ["TEST collector boot blocked at step 1 — paseo tools never injected on TEST daemon (task-12f20731ef; TEST daemon restarted 13:0xZ, retest pending) — plus orphan heartbeats 08c2b0ba/7e0a1707 and 16 idle collector sessions await creator/owner cleanup", "Collector roster still needs PR #69 merge (owner-gated) for track_list; sqlite fallback disclosed per wake until then"], "decisions": [], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": "empty guard results are assertions too - an empty mismatch list means KEEP the rows, and writing a placeholder instead of carrying them forward destroys the record the guard exists to protect", "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "4774f61c-0dca-4331-9a91-46e0ee32b238", "author_model": "opencode-go/mimo-v2.6-flash"}');
INSERT INTO orch_turns(n, project_id, track_id, ts, summary, status, done, next, blockers, decisions, knowledge, author_agent, author_model, raw) VALUES(202, 'p-b5bd663dcf', 't-62504d3c56', '2026-10-01T14:01:09.292Z', 'Deep tick (quiet). Quota: session 7%, week 15% — no consult. State unchanged since n201: no external events, 15 open (6 running). Rebuild used the exact recipe (3-turn blocker union = 2 rows, recomputed this build) -> diff CONSISTENT pre-commit (VERDICT_OK); 3155 tok, 35 tasks, 20 done; OKF 24 clean. Watches: gen2 send-log discipline + OWNER lines, renewal 17:00Z (first maxRuns48 gen), TEST retest after restart.', 'idle', '[]', '[]', '["TEST collector boot blocked at step 1 — paseo tools never injected on TEST daemon (task-12f20731ef; TEST daemon restarted 13:0xZ, retest pending) — plus orphan heartbeats 08c2b0ba/7e0a1707 and 16 idle collector sessions await creator/owner cleanup", "Collector roster still needs PR #69 merge (owner-gated) for track_list; sqlite fallback disclosed per wake until then"]', '[]', '{"lesson_topic": "the rebuild recipe is now mechanical - when a procedure has failed three times, encode it so the next wake cannot choose a wrong variant", "docs_updated": []}', '4774f61c-0dca-4331-9a91-46e0ee32b238', 'opencode-go/mimo-v2.6-flash', '{"n": 202, "ts": "2026-10-01T14:01:09.292Z", "summary": "Deep tick (quiet). Quota: session 7%, week 15% — no consult. State unchanged since n201: no external events, 15 open (6 running). Rebuild used the exact recipe (3-turn blocker union = 2 rows, recomputed this build) -> diff CONSISTENT pre-commit (VERDICT_OK); 3155 tok, 35 tasks, 20 done; OKF 24 clean. Watches: gen2 send-log discipline + OWNER lines, renewal 17:00Z (first maxRuns48 gen), TEST retest after restart.", "status": "idle", "done": [], "next": [], "blockers": ["TEST collector boot blocked at step 1 — paseo tools never injected on TEST daemon (task-12f20731ef; TEST daemon restarted 13:0xZ, retest pending) — plus orphan heartbeats 08c2b0ba/7e0a1707 and 16 idle collector sessions await creator/owner cleanup", "Collector roster still needs PR #69 merge (owner-gated) for track_list; sqlite fallback disclosed per wake until then"], "decisions": [], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": "the rebuild recipe is now mechanical - when a procedure has failed three times, encode it so the next wake cannot choose a wrong variant", "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "4774f61c-0dca-4331-9a91-46e0ee32b238", "author_model": "opencode-go/mimo-v2.6-flash"}');
