OND BOOKKEEPING DEFECT, MINE, NOT FIXABLE: G1''s gate reads ready while its own text says the candidates are the owner''s to choose, which is exactly what the collector picked up. I attempted user-decision and the server REFUSED: gate, like status, is immutable after creation, so the field tooling reads cannot be fixed in place. The correction is in the task note as an override; I am not duplicating the task to carry a right gate, because that trades one lie for a worse one. Third bookkeeping defect here. Still pending: the PROD deploy.", "status": "running", "done": [], "next": ["Owner: PROD deploy - merge PR #30 first or not, what branch PROD builds from, may I trigger the 6767 restart.", "G1 gate immutable; the task note carries the override."], "blockers": [], "decisions": [], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "e6e9642e-6e48-4b67-8773-3dd3967b9f1a", "author_model": "opencode-go/space-bunny-free"}');
