ision: run E2 (Strata cache shrunk) on rig; adopt vs port"], "blockers": [], "decisions": [], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "01afbe44-302f-485f-93d3-a170d036352e", "author_model": ""}');
