*, 280M/280M, probe archived. r31 deploy-gap routing confirmed correct. r32 task closed; T15 closed (MCP+local; delivered 23d2fe63d -> env 7d3052568 + FF feat/trajectory-plugin). LAST IMPLEMENTATION TASK DISPATCHED: task-52b9d33c5a persistence clear-path fix -> fresh dev 12da04bf in worktree fix/prefix-clear-persistence @ 7d3052568 (brief: fix 5 failing daemon-config-store clear cases without weakening tests, audit sibling per-key paths, gates -> push). Local+MCP mirrors aligned: 15/18 done, persistence in_progress, backlog+inode-policy owner-blocked. Both owner directives from today''s pair now fully QC-closed.", "status": "running", "done": ["QC r32 PASS processed; T15 closed", "Persistence fix dispatched to dev 12da04bf", "All mirrors aligned (15/18)"], "next": ["Persistence report -> merge -> deploy -> close", "Owner queue when free: PROD config reload, workflow cli-loop fix, GVS decision, mutated-store install --force, degeneracy backlog, bun-PATH workflow edit, PROD approval for batch 7d3052568"], "blockers": [], "decisions": [], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "b7bec94b-5394-453f-987a-6cb49107ad71", "author_model": ""}');
INSERT INTO orch_turns(n, project_id, track_id, ts, summary, status, done, next, blockers, decisions, knowledge, author_agent, author_model, raw) VALUES(363, 'p-b5bd663dcf', 't-f3ba82ac9c', '2026-10-03T13:08:30.257Z', 'T11''s modelPrefixes persistence is CORRECT. The 5/50 clear-case failures are an environmental stale-build artifact, not a code bug. packages/protocol exports resolve to built dist/ (gitignored, not src), so a packages/protocol/dist built before cad65e114 lacks modelPrefixes in ProviderOverrideSchema and ProviderOverrideSchema.strip() silently drops the whole key on the way to disk. Proved it by experiment, not inference.', 'idle', '["Read all 5 failing-case definitions in daemon-config-store.test.ts (lines 92-386) to establish intended behavior", "At env tip 7d3052568 on a fresh worktree the suite could not even load (ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND ''@getpaseo/protocol/provider-config'' — no dist at all), so installed deps + npm run build:protocol", "With a correct build: 50/50 PASS. No failure reproduced.", "Located the mechanism: packages/protocol/package.json exports ''./*'' -> ''./dist/*.js''; dist/ is gitignored; packages/server/vitest.config.ts aliases only @server, so protocol resolves to BUILT DIST, not src", "DECISIVE EXPERIMENT: built protocol from b173916c0 (parent of cad65e114, the commit that added modelPrefixes) -> dist confirmed to lack modelPrefixes -> ran the suite -> EXACTLY 5 failed / 45 passed, matching the brief''s list by name including ''clearing one sub-provider tag removes only that key, in memory and on disk''", "Restored protocol src to HEAD, rebuilt, re-verified 50/50 twice", "Sibling-path audit of every persistence removal path in the store", "Gates: targeted tests 50/50 green; packages/server typecheck clean after build:server-deps; lint 0 warnings/0 errors; branch pushed"]', '[]', '[]', '["Made no source change — the persistence path is already correct, so any edit would have been a fix applied to the wrong cause", "Did not create an empty commit; pushed the branch as-is so remote sha equals env tip — an empty ''fix'' commit would misrepresent this as a code change", "Did not add .min(1) to the modelPrefixes value schema to reject empty strings — no clear path produces one (a clear sends null) and narrowing a wire schema is forbidden by AGENTS.md; flagged in the report instead"]', '{"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}', '52b9d33c5a', 'opencode-go/space-bunny-free', '{"n": 363, "ts": "2026-10-03T13:08:30.257Z", "summary": "T11''s modelPrefixes persistence is CORRECT. The 5/50 clear-case failures are an environmental stale-build artifact, not a code bug. packages/protocol exports resolve to built dist/ (gitignored, not src), so a packages/protocol/dist built before cad65e114 lacks modelPrefixes in ProviderOverrideSchema and ProviderOverrideSchema.strip() silently drops the whole key on the way to disk. Proved it by experiment, not inference.", "status": "idle", "done": ["Read all 5 failing-case definitions in daemon-config-store.test.ts (lines 92-386) to establish intended behavior", "At env tip 7d3052568 on a fresh worktree the suite could not even load (ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND ''@getpaseo/protocol/provider-config'' — no dist at all), so installed deps + npm run build:protocol", "With a correct build: 50/50 PASS. No failure reproduced.", "Located the mechanism: packages/protocol/package.json exports ''./*'' -> ''./dist/*.js''; dist/ is gitignored; packages/server/vitest.config.ts aliases only @server, so protocol resolves to BUILT DIST, not src", "DECISIVE EXPERIMENT: built protocol from b173916c0 (parent of cad65e114, the commit that added modelPrefixes) -> dist confirmed to lack modelPrefixes -> ran the suite -> EXACTLY 5 failed / 45 passed, matching the brief''s list by name including ''clearing one sub-provider tag removes only that key, in memory and on disk''", "Restored protocol src to HEAD, rebuilt, re-verified 50/50 twice", "Sibling-path audit of every persistence removal path in the store", "Gates: targeted tests 50/50 green; packages/server typecheck clean after build:server-deps; lint 0 warnings/0 errors; branch pushed"], "next": [], "blockers": [], "decisions": ["Made no source change — the persistence path is already correct, so any edit would have been a fix applied to the wrong cause", "Did not create an empty commit; pushed the branch as-is so remote sha equals env tip — an empty ''fix'' commit would misrepresent this as a code change", "Did not add .min(1) to the modelPrefixes value schema to reject empty strings — no clear path produces one (a clear sends null) and narrowing a wire schema is forbidden by AGENTS.md; flagged in the report instead"], "knowledge": {"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}, "author_agent": "52b9d33c5a", "author_model": "opencode-go/space-bunny-free"}');
INSERT INTO orch_turns(n, project_id, track_id, ts, summary, status, done, next, blockers, decisions, knowledge, author_agent, author_model, raw) VALUES(364, 'p-b5bd663dcf', 't-f3ba82ac9c', '2026-10-03T13:10:53.206Z', 'PERSISTENCE TASK DISSOLVED (no bug) + ZERO OPEN TODOS. Dev 12da04bf root-caused the ''5/50 clear failures'' as STALE packages/protocol/dist: protocol maps ./* -> ./dist/*.js (gitignored), vitest aliases only @server so store code reads DIST; modelPrefixes (cad65e114) absent from old dist -> ProviderOverrideSchema.strip() (daemon-config-store.ts:442) silently dropped the field. Proven BOTH directions (pre-cad65e114 dist -> exact 5 named failures; HEAD rebuild -> 50/50); leader independently verified 50/50. Sibling-path audit all surgical (ordering: deletions post-override-merge -> no resurrection, test-proven). Gates clean; branch pushed identical to env tip (nothing to merge). Dev''s recurrence-guard offer (CI build workspace dists before server unit tests) parked for owner scope decision. Reclaimed prefix-clear-fix node_modules (+35,222; WorkDisk now 832,722 free = 75% used after coordinator+my drains). TRACK: 16/18 done, 0 open, 2 owner-blocked (degeneracy backlog, inode relief policy). All implementation work COMPLETE.', 'running', '["Persistence dissolved as environment artifact; verified 50/50", "Worktree reclaimed (+35k); zero open todos", "Task closed with full root-cause evidence"]', '["Track = fully closed except owner-gated items: degeneracy decision, inode policy, PROD config reload, PROD deploy approval, workflow cli fix, GVS decision, mutated-store force, bun-PATH workflow edit"]', '[]', '[]', '{"lesson_topic": null, "docs_updated": []}', 'b7bec94b-5394-453f-987a-6cb49107ad71', '', '{"n": 364, "ts": "2026-10-03T13:10:53.206Z", "summary": "PERSISTENCE TASK DISSOLVED (no bug) + ZERO OPEN TODOS. Dev 12da04bf root-caused the ''5/50 clear failures'' as STALE packages/protocol/dist: protocol maps ./* -> ./dist/*.js (gitignored), vitest aliases 