e expert-atlas pipeline output; bun.lock is committed correctly (.gitignore only ignores node_modules/dist/*.tsbuildinfo). Docs consistent (PORTS_AND_ENV.md documents :8620 + HYDRA_EXPERT_META=1, matches PROJECT_STATUS.md).\n\nTrack migration note: handoff referenced non-existent track t-34d7bdf5d6; correct active track is t-d1cf43b723 (baseline-flash-next) where colibri/atlas/telemetry items were folded per owner directive d-556c6cc692.\n\nSuggested follow-ups (nits, not blockers): document geometry KV numeric contract; advance or drop the ik-llama-cpp pin.", "status": "done", "pr": "ddvnguyen/hydra_vortex#789", "artifacts": [], "reported_at": "2026-09-26T09:55:37.939Z", "evaluation": {"confidence": 92, "effectiveness": 90, "guideline_adherence": 95, "task_complexity": 75, "task_size": 60, "notes": "All four review items independently verified against branch HEAD with git/tsc/schema evidence, not trusting handoff. tsc actually run (tsc --build + tsc -p tsconfig.app.json exit 0). Discovered handoff track_id was stale; found correct active track via track_list/track_status.", "telemetry": null}}');
