INSERT INTO orch_events(id, project_id, track_id, type, ts, payload) VALUES(3923, 'p-b5bd663dcf', 't-f3ba82ac9c', 'worker_reported', '2026-09-28T08:59:47.979Z', '{"agent_id": "p0-qc-playwright", "role": "qc-playwright", "model": "muse-spark-1.3-contributor", "task": "R14 C4 final acceptance on TEST (:6969?v=c4r14)", "summary": "R14 C4 final: FAIL on A1b (sole defect, unchanged from R13). A1a PASS: fresh load header press opens 1 panel for active agent f52fda02 at t=1s, 0 errors. A1b FAIL 3/3: exact R13 repro (direct-load wks_cbd3, sidebar-click ORCHESTRATOR tab -> wks_f700) then header press = 10s silence (no panel, no toast testids/text, no console error) all 3 reps. Characterization: CC open in IDENTICAL state succeeds (f52fda02, proves resolvability); 2nd press after +15s settle still 0 (stuck, not timing); fresh reload recovers (1 panel). No guard/timeout toast ever appeared, so no PASS-with-guard; verbatim toast N/A. A1d PASS: switch workspaces via fresh loads opens NEW agent b1b058fa, no stale, 0 errors. A1e: no-agent workspace not reachable on TEST (all workspaces restore active tabs; reaching one needs destructive tab closing) - stated, untested. Spots PASS: CC open = {dlg:1,panels:1}; keyed user row resolves inline; mobile 390 icon-only (40px) tap = 1 panel correct agent at t=1s; zero console/page errors every run. Audit 186 lines: turn_failed=0, 426-hits=0; 12 level-50 = known Unknown-agent bursts (ctx-inject 3x + paseo-fleet 1x per agent screen-open, R11/R13 disclosed class, both plugins same pattern = daemon-side race); 1 external-owner noise (Mac Chrome provider-ls 8s post-restart, not QC traffic). Bundle index-fdef994a verified, plugin ready 08:51:09Z. Overall C4 acceptance: FAIL - header button still goes silently dead after client-side navigation.", "status": "done", "pr": "", "artifacts": ["/path/to/home/paseo-qc/r14-a1a-open.png", "/path/to/home/paseo-qc/r14-a1b-rep1-silent.png", "/path/to/home/paseo-qc/r14-a1d-switch.png", "/path/to/home/paseo-qc/