now has a candidate mechanism. This is forward progress, not another lap of the correction loop.", "Pattern now reads: v117 stale report -> v119 inverted rationale -> v121 over-claim -> v123 reversal -> v127 fix a non-bug -> v128 reversal -> v129 confound decomposition. 4 self-caught reversals, but the last one changed a wrong number into a decomposed mechanism. Detection latency remains 1 tick. Health 7-8 unchanged, carried forward from wake 5, not re-scored.", "Quiet streak before this: 3 no-delta wakes (6,7 and part of 5) with v128 age climbing 17->856->1338s, all inside the track''s 5-6 no-delta baseline. Streak broken, no anomaly to carry forward.", "UNCHANGED, not re-polled: t-f3ba82ac9c IDLE; t-a124729a8a PR #30 open; t-abf10888f3 + t-34d7bdf5d6 frozen undeliverable; t-2328df2e93 complete.", "no digest, no escalation, no messages (wakes_remaining 15 > 1)"], "reported_at": "2026-09-29T09:55:34.822Z"}');
