s. That gap is a live open question, not a resolved one.", "Health 7-8, set at wake 5, carried forward, NOT re-scored. I am deliberately not upgrading on one good turn: the wake-11 flag was about a rate (3 of 4 turns retracting), and one non-retracting turn does not clear a rate. The flag''s stated condition was a FOURTH retraction, and this is not one.", "What to watch next, stated once: whether v132 explains the 1.5x fit-vs-logged gap. If the next turn retracts v131, the rate resumes and health 6 becomes live. Not pre-judging — recording the decision point.", "UNCHANGED, not re-polled: t-f3ba82ac9c IDLE; t-a124729a8a PR #30 open; t-abf10888f3 + t-34d7bdf5d6 frozen undeliverable; t-2328df2e93 complete.", "no digest, no escalation, no messages (wakes_remaining 15 > 1)"], "reported_at": "2026-09-29T10:26:21.353Z"}');
