nce 2026-09-26 and T2 depends on it — a scheduling gap, not a fault; the lane is correctly parked awaiting owner. | action_taken: NO MESSAGE.", "DIGEST t-a124729a8a (leader e6e9642e) | active | last_turn_age_s 17535 (~4.9h) | tasks {total 9, done 6, open 3} | anomalies [{track-stale, track, thr 600, obs 17535, why: ''leader DELETED its own heartbeat 2adab451 by decision 2026-09-28T22:07 and parked; heartbeats block entirely null confirms deliberate, not stalled''}] | health 7 | recommended_action: none. PR #30 open and MERGEABLE (26 files, +2854/-168); S5b (task-24a2ae9fa4) correctly gated at user-decision awaiting owner budget. | action_taken: NO MESSAGE.", "DIGEST t-abf10888f3 (leader 14fe3d01) | active | last_turn_age_s 89120 (~24.7h) | tasks {total 48, done 20, open 28} | anomalies [{track-stale, leader 14fe3d01, thr 600, obs 89120, why: ''leader runs omp + command_code/z-ai/glm-5.3-flash, a provider ABSENT from the live catalog; track asserts model_verified:true but that is STALE (signed 09-26, never re-checked). UNREACHABLE, not idle.''}, {dev-slow, 28 open incl P0s F11/F12, thr 3600, obs 89120, why: ''F11 session-hangs-on-in-use-account and F12 composer-account-select are owner-reported P0s stranded behind an undeliverable leader''}] | health 4 | recommended_action: OWNER MUST RE-LEADER. Live-verified leader-tier option omp/opencode-go/glm-5.3-flash (priority 1) is the same family, so a re-leader is spawnable on authorisation. | action_taken: ESCALATION ATTEMPTED, FAILED AS PREDICTED.", "DIGEST t-34d7bdf5d6 (leader a572d1d1) | UNREACHABLE not idle — zero catalog entries for this leader''s provider. Established by prior generation; not re-probed (re-probing an unchanged unreachable target is command-spam). Escalation would fail identically. | health <=3 | action_taken: recorded UNDELIVERABLE-NEEDS-HUMAN, not retried.", "DIGEST t-62504d3c56 (collector-owned) | active | last_turn_age_s 480 | tasks {P2-1..12 all done, A-E queued} | anomalies [{track-stale, t-2387