e and update; both now use defaultCwd(). Suite 418/8 -> 430/8; plugin typecheck clean + 9/9; all PR checks pass.", "status": "done", "pr": "ddvnguyen/LLM-Agents-Orchestration#69", "artifacts": [], "reported_at": "2026-10-01T01:28:13.854Z"}');
