-ranks.json (48 layers hot-first, reap_saliency null reserved) + out/experts.pin (top-53/layer, 2544 ids, parser-site validated). LOP HOST-DEGENERATE reported honestly (1 run/category corpus; 2/2 in-sample hit, NOT generalisation). Committed parent fa2a4cd67 (pipeline) + 038f57e73 (design doc). Next: multi-domain traces from task-4e0493edd2 upgrade draft; atlas-web scaffold next; fork stages after Stage-1 lands.", "rationale": "Owner asked done-status; worker settled, artifacts independently re-verified (reproduce rerun PASS, JSON structure spot-checked, pin header/format matches parser discipline).", "source": "leader", "irreversible": false, "author": "ddvnguyen"}');
