rgence-point methodology replaces it. (4) Rig contention: route-trace worker d1b87d1d ordered to yield GPU after current leg; builder''s A_rep+C_rep go next. Shutdown abort fixed (atexit dump ordering).", "rationale": "", "source": "leader", "irreversible": false, "author": ""}');
