pparatus, admits nothing), arm2 ON N=38 (real); N runtime param enables N-sweep next round ({0,20,38,56} one session). Branch cost mitigated by hoisting out of per-expert inner loop (per-layer/token decide); arm1-arm0 = residual branch cost, arm2-arm1 = true admission overhead (decomposes O/D=0.1298). MMQ scope: audit covers MMQ AND MMVQ branches; byte-identical-OFF + KLD candidate demonstrated ON MMQ PATH (what decode executes); admission sites x {MMQ,MMVQ} fired/not-fired matrix (closes admission flag at dispatch granularity). All three arms on MMQ path. Reply: CONFIRMED-ladder, no contest.", "rationale": "", "source": "consult", "irreversible": false, "author": ""}');
