ext); (5) gate-off intact VERIFIED (sweep+README+2 comments only, runtime proof carries). Then merge-ready: FF-merge + push + bump; live leg stays S-E1. Sweep-only edits; diff-only re-check closes.", "rationale": "", "source": "consult", "irreversible": false, "author": ""}');
