ISFIED.", "rationale": "Full acceptance suite green on TEST after the binary PATH remediation; owner''s chosen acceptance model (space-bunny-free Go variant) streamed correctly.", "source": "leader", "irreversible": false, "author": "64b0b20e-2a1e-4759-b87e-9c3ea56b67cb"}');
