The plugin is ungated at THREE independent levels. Only the third is the one the dev hit:
1. plugins/trajectory is NOT a workspace member. Root package.json workspaces = [expo-two-way-audio, highlight, plugin, protocol, client, server, app, relay, website, desktop, cli]. The plugin''s name is paseo-plugin-trajectory and it has its own typecheck (tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.json) and test (vitest run) scripts, but nothing in the monorepo invokes them.
2. No CI workflow: grep -rln trajectory .github/workflows/ is empty; .github/workflows/paseo-orchestration-plugin.yml gates plugins/paseo-orchestration only. G0 (task-4879b96968) covers this level.
