On the live corpus that is three fetches over 4116 events plus one over 549 decisions, to build a ten-line summary. Cost scales linearly with track age and is paid on every orchestrator wake, every collector poll, and every track_status call in the runbook''s recommended turn loop. That is the mechanism behind the slow status reads, not the JSON scanner.

